---
title: "transfer_unlocked (Sui Move Concepts: Custom Transfer Rules)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_unlock: check object.unlocked == true
    q_check_unlock --> q_transfer: object.unlocked == true
    q_check_unlock --> q_abort: object.unlocked == false
    q_transfer --> q_set_owner: transfer::transfer(object, to)
    q_set_owner --> [*]: object is now owned by to

    q_abort --> [*]: abort EObjectLocked

    note right of q_check_unlock
        INV-001: Object without store ability can only be transferred by defining module
        INV-002: Custom transfer enforces unlocked == true before transfer
    end note

    note right of q_transfer
        INV-003: transfer::transfer (not public_transfer) used for objects without store
        INV-004: Only the defining module can call transfer::transfer for this type
    end note
